327
00:26:32,255 --> 00:26:32,755
Louie!

328
00:26:32,964 --> 00:26:33,423
Louie!

329
00:26:33,423 --> 00:26:34,048
Louie!

330
00:26:34,841 --> 00:26:36,134
Think of Venice.

331
00:26:36,426 --> 00:26:37,760
Think of Venice.

332
00:26:38,845 --> 00:26:39,637
Louie.

333
