433
00:35:54,191 --> 00:35:56,652
We'll kill Aemie Roswell.

434
00:36:00,723 --> 00:36:01,675
Let's go.

435
00:36:27,099 --> 00:36:28,225
Zeke.

436
00:36:28,225 --> 00:36:29,351
Let's go.

437
00:37:06,722 --> 00:37:11,519
