452
00:38:04,864 --> 00:38:07,157
Your gown has a gun
pocket near your thighs.

453
00:38:07,741 --> 00:38:08,654
Look.

454
00:38:08,784 --> 00:38:09,583
Huh?

455
00:38:11,969 --> 00:38:13,137
Hey!

456
00:38:14,540 --> 00:38:15,669
Give me that.

457
00:38:37,104 --> 00:38:38,063
