458
00:38:39,940 --> 00:38:40,849
Yes.

459
00:38:42,401 --> 00:38:43,443
Relax.

460
00:38:43,986 --> 00:38:44,818
I'm here.

461
00:38:48,223 --> 00:38:49,258
Okay.

462
00:38:49,283 --> 00:38:50,380
Let's go.

463
