477
00:42:39,721 --> 00:42:40,697
Enjoy.

478
00:42:40,722 --> 00:42:41,056
Yes.

479
00:42:41,056 --> 00:42:41,740
Thank you.

480
00:42:41,765 --> 00:42:42,141
Thank you.

481
00:42:42,141 --> 00:42:43,303
