492
00:43:13,255 --> 00:43:14,006
Cheers.

493
00:43:15,257 --> 00:43:16,592
Congratulations, wife.

494
00:43:17,676 --> 00:43:18,510
Thank you, Dong.

495
00:43:18,510 --> 00:43:19,553
I'm so proud of you.

496
00:44:03,305 --> 00:44:03,828
Hey!

497
00:44:03,853 --> 00:44:04,792
