501
00:44:12,481 --> 00:44:13,557
A bomb?

502
00:44:13,732 --> 00:44:14,526
Yeah.

503
00:44:15,484 --> 00:44:16,460
Come here.

504
00:44:16,485 --> 00:44:17,819
