505
00:44:19,112 --> 00:44:20,030
Hold this.

506
00:44:23,116 --> 00:44:25,786
Don't move if you don't
want us both to blow up here.

507
00:44:32,299 --> 00:44:33,175
Actually,

508
00:44:33,877 --> 00:44:35,087
