511
00:44:43,512 --> 00:44:44,488
Oh.

512
00:44:44,513 --> 00:44:45,472
Really?

513
00:44:48,308 --> 00:44:49,184
You look cute like that.

514
00:44:50,936 --> 00:44:51,979
Fine, never mind.

515
00:44:53,313 --> 00:44:54,564
No, no, no.

516
00:44:54,814 --> 00:44:55,749
It's okay.

517
00:44:55,930 --> 00:44:58,599
Auntie Alyana hired me
to help you anyway.

518
00:44:59,027 --> 00:45:00,070
So, I can do it.

519
00:45:00,070 --> 00:45:00,904
I can do it.

520
00:45:06,868 --> 00:45:08,543
Focus on what you're doing.

521
00:45:10,791 --> 00:45:12,000
As you wish, baby.

522
00:45:20,465 --> 00:45:21,508
I wonder where Lampe is.

523
00:45:23,260 --> 00:45:24,386
Just leave him alone, bro.

524
00:45:24,970 --> 00:45:26,680
