559
00:47:04,736 --> 00:47:07,447
45 degrees south
and 90 degrees west.

560
00:47:11,701 --> 00:47:12,680
A road?

561
00:47:13,870 --> 00:47:15,872
What does this mean?

562
00:47:16,373 --> 00:47:17,958
Maybe we need to go here.

563
00:47:21,095 --> 00:47:22,055
What's so funny?

564
00:47:22,712 --> 00:47:23,617
Relax.

565
00:47:23,755 --> 00:47:25,117
Everything is under control.

566
00:47:26,258 --> 00:47:27,801
