what their plans are.

569
00:47:33,140 --> 00:47:34,109
Okay, calm down.

570
00:47:35,016 --> 00:47:37,185
I know it's your job to
protect Ma'am Aemie.

571
00:47:37,727 --> 00:47:38,687
And don't worry.

572
00:47:39,271 --> 00:47:41,189
Mr. Roswell knows
what he's doing.

573
00:47:41,356 --> 00:47:42,506
Why do you think

574
00:47:42,732 --> 00:47:45,944
they would go through with the toy company
launch if Ma'am Aemie would be in danger?

575
00:47:55,912 --> 00:47:57,146
What do you need?

576
00:48:23,190 --> 00:48:25,150
Who ordered you to come here?

577
00:48:25,567 --> 00:48:26,610
Yaji!

578
00:48:26,985 --> 00:48:27,904
Yaji?

579
00:48:28,570 --> 00:48:29,389
Liar!

580
00:48:34,493 --> 00:48:35,385
We better go.

581
00:48:35,410 --> 00:48:36,703
The program is about to start.

582
00:48:37,579 --> 00:48:38,724
How's the system?

583
00:48:40,081 --> 00:48:40,999
It's back to normal.

584
00:48:40,999 --> 00:48:41,583
No worries.

585
00:48:43,543 --> 00:48:45,086
We need to split up.

586
00:48:46,087 --> 00:48:46,935
Huh?

587
00:48:47,130 --> 00:48:48,334
You're not coming with me?

588
00:48:48,548 --> 00:48:49,365
No.

589
00:48:49,966 --> 00:48:51,384
Someone might see us.

590
00:48:52,302 --> 00:48:53,069
Okay.

591
00:48:53,094 --> 00:48:54,154
Keep safe.

592
00:48:54,179 --> 00:48:54,596
Miss Guar—

593
00:48:54,596 --> 00:48:55,537
Fauzia.

594
00:48:56,097 --> 00:48:57,516
Just call me Fauzia.

595
00:48:58,674 --> 00:48:59,498
Okay.

596
00:48:59,893 --> 00:49:00,744
See you.

597
00:49:00,769 --> 00:49:01,764
Fauzia.

598
00:49:04,397 --> 00:49:05,398
Stay alive.

599
00:49:11,988 --> 00:49:12,842
I will.

600
00:50:13,216 --> 00:50:14,779
Mr. Roswell. Ma'am Aemie.

601
00:50:16,136 --> 00:50:17,131
Boss.

602
00:50:21,266 --> 00:50:21,926
Damn!

603
00:50:21,951 --> 00:50:23,953
You guys are looking handsome!

604
00:50:25,604 --> 00:50:27,397
Good thing they've finally arrived.

605
00:50:27,647 --> 00:50:29,608
I don't know anyone here,
they're the only ones I know.

606
00:50:36,615 --> 00:50:37,616
Like I've said,

607
00:50:38,491 --> 00:50:40,535
Yaji is not our enemy here.

608
00:50:41,620 --> 00:50:44,998
The purpose of this launch
is to expose the enemy.

609
00:51:01,765 --> 00:51:02,616
Shit!

610
00:51:02,641 --> 00:51:03,389
Why?

611
00:51:08,563 --> 00:51:10,190
We're not the only snipers here.

612
00:51:11,399 --> 00:51:12,568
There are others.

613
00:51:33,963 --> 00:51:36,174
I bet you came here
to see your daughter.

614
00:51:37,926 --> 00:51:39,678
Why haven't you joined them yet?

615
00:51:39,969 --> 00:51:40,845
No.

616
00:51:41,471 --> 00:51:43,515
Actually, I came
here to see you dead.

617
00:51:44,683 --> 00:51:45,809
Mr. Roswell.

618
00:51:47,018 --> 00:51:47,894
Mr. Ferrer.

619
00:51:48,144 --> 00:51:48,770
This is...

620
00:51:49,020 --> 00:51:50,271
Violet Swansea.

621
00:51:50,897 --> 00:51:52,065
Hello, good evening.

622
00:51:52,232 --> 00:51:55,276
This is my wife,
Aemie Ferrer-Roswell.

623
00:51:55,402 --> 00:51:56,534
The daughter...

624
00:51:56,611 --> 00:51:58,571
of Alyana Heartily-Ferrer.

625
00:51:59,114 --> 00:52:00,128
Zeke.

626
00:52:03,076 --> 00:52:04,786
Mei, why don't you
just stop your plan?

627
00:52:04,869 --> 00:52:06,579
Are you out of your mind, Cass?

628
00:52:07,038 --> 00:52:08,957
She's absolutely fine, sis.

629
00:52:12,961 --> 00:52:14,462
It's already a blackout.

630
00:52:22,220 --> 00:52:23,888
Mommy, what happened?!

631
00:52:24,013 --> 00:52:25,807
Who did this to you, mommy?

632
00:52:25,832 --> 00:52:26,374
Who?!

633
00:52:26,474 --> 00:52:27,726
Mommy!

634
00:52:28,560 --> 00:52:29,534
Roswell.

635
00:52:29,936 --> 00:52:30,687
Wife.
